" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2260550/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1689846724\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2260550/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1689846724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2260550/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1689846724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game is currently at an early stage of development. Write your ideas and wishes, and we will implement the most interesting ideas.<br>We also need your support - add the game to your wishlist, so you will help the development of the game and be the first to know the news.",
